      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1  Raw path: simulator -> esspark -> ehspark.RawEvents -> OneLake availability -> lhspark.RawEvents shortcut.\n2  Scoring path: filtered Kafka -> Spark -> per-event KQL average -> private REST API -> lhspark.Scores.\n3  Event path: the same KQL enrichment -> lhspark.Events, independently of API success.\nBlue VM, purple Fabric and green API outlines are logical perimeters. Key Vault is a shared Azure dependency outside those three.\nSolid arrows = application data or request/result path. Dashed arrows = supporting secrets, storage or recovery state.\nCurrent design retains staged recovery/audit commits; the proposed two-commit redesign is NOT deployed.\nFabric items are capacity/workspace-scoped SaaS artifacts, not individual ARM resources in the Azure resource group.",
      "originalText": "1  Raw path: simulator -> esspark -> ehspark.RawEvents -> OneLake availability -> lhspark.RawEvents shortcut.\n2  Scoring path: filtered Kafka -> Spark -> per-event KQL average -> private REST API -> lhspark.Scores.\n3  Event path: the same KQL enrichment -> lhspark.Events, independently of API success.\nBlue VM, purple Fabric and green API outlines are logical perimeters. Key Vault is a shared Azure dependency outside those three.\nSolid arrows = application data or request/result path. Dashed arrows = supporting secrets, storage or recovery state.\nCurrent design retains staged recovery/audit commits; the proposed two-commit redesign is NOT deployed.\nFabric items are capacity/workspace-scoped SaaS artifacts, not individual ARM resources in the Azure resource group.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
  ],
